<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-16"?>
<!--
  Reference export of the DeresoRepoStage root-server Scheduled Task (07-03 Task 3).
  Authoritative generator: scripts/Register-AutomationTasks.ps1 -TaskName DeresoRepoStage
  (which registers the task then re-exports this file via `schtasks /Query /TN ... /XML`).
  Hand-authored here because running the generator registers real tasks on the host;
  07-05 regenerates this on the real BES root server.

  NO schedule trigger by design: this task is started on demand and is chained from a
  successful DeresoContentSync run (Invoke-ContentSync.ps1 calls Start-ScheduledTask
